# Local agent skill mirror — canonical copy is tracked under .claude/skills/
.agents/

# .claude/launch.json IS TRACKED (2026-08-02). It was ignored because it pinned a machine-specific
# absolute node path — and that is precisely what made it useless: the path
# (/opt/homebrew/opt/node@22/bin/node) stopped existing, so the one launch config AGENTS.md points
# developers at could not start, and being untracked meant nobody could receive the fix either. It is
# now plain `npx next dev`, which is machine-independent, so the reason for ignoring it is gone.
# Re-ignore it only if it regains host-specific paths — and if it does, give AGENTS.md a tracked
# template to point at instead of an ignored file.
